  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's combined perception and action capabilities, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification automata E1\u2013E3 enforce safe, efficient exploration: E1 binds perception outcomes to unique, safe actions; E2 prevents move_forward when an obstacle is detected in front; E3 ensures recovery after obstacle_front before resuming forward movement. All automata are deterministic, total on uncontrollables, and respect the event and state constraints.",
